  <static seed="241" source="Library/PCC/BasicAlgebra/Exponents/exponentsMultiplication0.pg">
    <statement><p>Use the properties of exponents to simplify the following</p>
<p><m>{x^{15}}\cdot{x^{8}} =</m>
<fillin characters="12" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>x^{23}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>We <em>add</em> the exponents as follows</p>
<p><m>\begin{aligned}
           x^{15}\cdot x^{8}\amp =x^{15+8}\\
                             \amp =x^{23}
       \end{aligned}</m></p>
</solution>
